# Per-field decode over every Stage 4 specimen in the corpus: where each
# field sits and every raw value the corpus has been seen to put there. No
# specimen count, so adding specimens only shows up when they reach a value
# not reached before. UNVARYING marks a field the corpus cannot check — on a
# factory bank that is most of the morph targets.
#
# One line per field, and no decoded column: nothing here is interpreted, so
# the decoded value restates the raw one and only the placement can be wrong.


